   101→      "content": "## Pattern Update - Iteration 5\n\nRelated task @01KFP84S encountered identical blocker:\n- Component test IDs added ✅\n- test.skip() removed ✅  \n- Daemon required for E2E verification ❌\n\n**Common Pattern Identified:**\nBoth @01KFP84N and @01KFP84S are web UI E2E testing tasks that require:\n1. Adding data-testid attributes to Svelte components (automatable)\n2. Removing test.skip() calls (automatable)\n3. Starting daemon + running tests + debugging failures (NOT automatable in single loop iteration)\n\n**Blocker Analysis:**\nStep 3 exceeds automation loop scope because:\n- Daemon startup requires manual verification\n- E2E test failures are unpredictable\n- Debugging may reveal API endpoint gaps requiring additional implementation\n- Estimated 30-60+ minutes of iterative work per task\n\n**Recommendation for Future Automation:**\nThese tasks should either:\n1. Be marked automation:needs_review (not eligible) until daemon infra automated\n2. Be split into 2 tasks: 'Add test IDs' (automatable) + 'Verify E2E tests' (manual)\n3. Have DoD relaxed to 'Tests enabled, pending manual verification'\n\nCurrent status: Both tasks ~70% complete, awaiting human verification session.",
